    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u07.d04.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "(a) few / (a) little · one / ones",
        "ru": "(a) few / (a) little · one / ones"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Use \"a few\" with countable nouns and \"a little\" with uncountable nouns for a small amount. Use \"one/ones\" instead of repeating the noun.",
        "ru": "\"a few\" — с исчисляемыми, \"a little\" — с неисчисляемыми (небольшое количество). \"one/ones\" — вместо повтора существительного."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "a few",
            "ru": "a few"
          },
          "formula": "a few + countable plural",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "I have a few apples.",
              "ru": "У меня есть несколько яблок."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "a little",
            "ru": "a little"
          },
          "formula": "a little + uncountable",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "I have a little milk.",
              "ru": "У меня есть немного молока."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "one / ones",
            "ru": "one / ones"
          },
          "formula": "the red one · the big ones",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Which cup? The blue one.",
              "ru": "Какая чашка? Синяя."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "\"few\" (no \"a\") means almost none: \"few people came\".",
          "ru": "\"few\" (без \"a\") — почти никого: \"few people came\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "Use \"ones\" for plural: \"the small ones\", not \"the small one\" for many.",
          "ru": "Для множественного — \"ones\": \"the small ones\", а не \"the small one\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u07.d04.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "A quick shopping trip",
        "ru": "Быстрый поход за покупками"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u07.d04.reading.b1",
          "en": "I only needed a few things for dinner: a kilo of apples, a packet of rice and a little cheese. At the shop there were a lot of fruits.",
          "ru": "Мне нужно было всего несколько вещей на ужин: килограмм яблок, пачка риса и немного сыра. В магазине было много фруктов.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u07.d04.reading.b1.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u07.d04.reading.b2",
          "en": "\"Which apples do you want?\" asked the man. \"The red ones, please, and a bottle of water.\" I paid and went home with a full bag.",
          "ru": "«Какие яблоки вам нужны?» — спросил мужчина. «Красные, пожалуйста, и бутылку воды». Я заплатил и пошёл домой с полной сумкой.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u07.d04.reading.b2.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
